        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Both triangles are right-angled, and their hypotenuses and another pair of corresponding sides are in the same ratio (RHS).",
          "worked": "Both triangles are right-angled. Their hypotenuses and another pair of corresponding sides are in the same ratio:\n$$\\frac{10}{25}=\\frac{6}{15}=\\frac{2}{5}.$$\nTherefore, the triangles are similar by RHS.",
